I am working on a patch for i2c and device tree. I attached the current version.

DTC entry looks like this.

		i2c@3d40 {
			compatible = "mpc5200b-i2c","mpc5200-i2c","fsl-i2c";
			reg = <3d40 40>;
			interrupts = <2 10 0>;
			interrupt-parent = <&mpc5200_pic>;
			fsl5200-clocking;

			rtc@51f {
				compatible = "epson,rtc8564";
				reg = <51>;
			};
		};
		


